<tt xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" leadingSilence="0"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">“说的不是你哦”——我真想当作是自己多心了</text><text for="L2">就算被揭穿也要搪塞过去，别理他们</text><text for="L3">按身高、按五十音排队，我连排在那里都不想</text><text for="L4">干脆用竹刀教训那个可笑的家伙——别让我落单啊</text><text for="L5">不和谁待在一起，我就没有可以躲避的地方啊</text><text for="L6">奇迹般的目光，暂时还请别移开</text><text for="L7">把那些厌恶我的“小鸟”的笑声消掉吧</text><text for="L8">专注力强到近乎失态</text><text for="L9">到家了，吐出一口气，在第七个 Twitter 账号上发发牢骚</text><text for="L10">不过是每天熟练地交接 ATP、消耗着活力而已</text><text for="L11">真是的，直觉太准，真不甘心啊</text><text for="L12">若能无意识地把一切推进下去，应该就轻松了吧</text><text for="L13">我没法若无其事地笑，只能不住地装出没事</text><text for="L14">总是哈哈大笑、堵住我去路的人们啊</text><text for="L15">我竟只说得出一句感谢啊</text><text for="L16">不必再回头了</text><text for="L17">眼下就只管回家睡觉</text><text for="L18">越觉得不对劲，越会不由自主地点头</text><text for="L19">不许把情绪写在脸上</text><text for="L20">哭到精疲力竭吧，学会重启自己</text><text for="L21">既然没兴趣，就别管我</text><text for="L22">难关、难解、哪一层，偏偏还会弄错——一点也不好笑的笑话</text><text for="L23">只剩下望着下周菜单度日</text><text for="L24">真是的，直觉太准，真不甘心啊</text><text for="L25">若能无意识地把一切推进下去，应该就轻松了吧</text><text for="L26">我没法若无其事地笑，只能不住地装出没事</text><text for="L27">总是哈哈大笑、堵住我去路的人们啊</text><text for="L28">我竟只说得出一句感谢啊</text><text for="L29">不必再回头了</text><text for="L30">眼下就只管回家睡觉</text><text for="L31">你给的毒草莓，你那未被满足的“一号”</text><text for="L32">我要把它吃下去，绝不会让你忘记</text><text for="L33">从曾经的泪水、所谓的错误答案、矛盾的逻辑中</text><text for="L34">直到我终于能够拯救（自己/某个身陷其中的人）</text><text for="L35">真是的，直觉太敏锐，真让人不甘心</text><text for="L36">要是能不经意识、顺其自然地活下去，应该会轻松吧</text><text for="L37">我没法若无其事地笑，只能不住地装出没事</text><text for="L38">总是哈哈哈哈大笑、堵住我去路的人们啊</text><text for="L39">我竟只说得出一句感谢啊</text><text for="L40">不必再回头了</text><text for="L41">眼下就只管回家睡觉</text><text for="L42">我不想让人知道</text><text for="L43">可要是能说出“我希望你知道”就好了</text><text for="L44">直觉偏偏变得太准的日子，我会忍不住喊出来</text><text for="L45">咿耶！咿耶！咿耶！咿耶！</text><text for="L46">在远处、在无人之处，正面对着你</text><text for="L47">遗影、遗咏；遗影、遗咏；遗影、遗咏；遗影——死体</text></translation></translations><translations/><songwriters><songwriter>ACAね</songwriter><songwriter>ラムシーニ</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Kan Saete Kuyashiiwa"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="ZUTOMAYO"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Imawa Imade Chikaiwa Emide - EP"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1464108341"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:58.347"><div begin="19.861" end="45.074" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="19.861" end="23.035" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.861" end="19.961">「</span><span begin="19.961" end="20.349">君のこと</span><span begin="20.349" end="20.531">じゃ</span><span begin="20.531" end="20.744">な</span><span begin="20.744" end="21.261">いよ</span><span begin="21.261" end="21.361">」</span> <span begin="21.456" end="22.068">気のせいに</span><span begin="22.068" end="22.358">した</span><span begin="22.358" end="22.732">い</span><span begin="22.732" end="23.035">よ</span></p><p begin="23.045" end="26.130" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="23.045" end="23.359">ばれ</span><span begin="23.359" end="23.642">たって</span><span begin="23.642" end="24.075">誤魔化</span><span begin="24.075" end="24.453">すの</span> <span begin="24.554" end="25.286">相手に</span><span begin="25.286" end="25.845">しない</span><span begin="25.845" end="26.130">で</span></p><p begin="26.144" end="29.418" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.144" end="26.494">背の</span><span begin="26.494" end="26.731">順</span><span begin="26.731" end="26.916">あい</span><span begin="26.916" end="27.681">うえお</span> <span begin="27.865" end="28.483">並びたくも</span><span begin="28.483" end="28.967">ない</span><span begin="28.967" end="29.418">よ</span></p><p begin="29.428" end="32.657" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.428" end="29.751">もう</span><span begin="29.751" end="30.082">いっそ</span> <span begin="30.082" end="30.703">お目出度</span><span begin="30.703" end="30.889">い</span> <span begin="30.889" end="31.666">一人を</span><span begin="31.666" end="32.272">竹刀</span><span begin="32.272" end="32.657">で</span></p><p begin="32.667" end="35.797" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.667" end="33.135">誰かと</span><span begin="33.135" end="33.853">いない</span><span begin="33.853" end="34.138">と</span> <span begin="34.300" end="34.753">避難場所</span><span begin="34.753" end="34.931">は</span><span begin="34.931" end="35.416">ない</span><span begin="35.416" end="35.797">よ</span></p><p begin="35.820" end="38.967" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.820" end="36.444">ミラクルな</span><span begin="36.444" end="36.870">目を</span> <span begin="36.870" end="37.287">まだ</span><span begin="37.287" end="38.022">逸らせは</span><span begin="38.022" end="38.613">しない</span><span begin="38.613" end="38.967">で</span></p><p begin="39.030" end="42.218" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.030" end="39.544">あたしを</span><span begin="39.544" end="39.992">嫌う</span><span begin="39.992" end="40.510">鳥の</span> <span begin="40.641" end="41.016">笑い</span><span begin="41.016" end="41.252">声を</span><span begin="41.252" end="41.528">消</span><span begin="41.528" end="42.218">そうよ</span></p><p begin="42.220" end="45.074" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.220" end="42.819">端</span><span begin="42.819" end="43.275">ない</span><span begin="43.275" end="43.731">ほど</span><span begin="43.731" end="44.031">集</span><span begin="44.031" end="44.488">中</span><span begin="44.488" end="44.820">力</span><span begin="44.820" end="45.074">が</span></p></div><div begin="45.278" end="57.569" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="45.278" end="51.544" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.278" end="45.923">着いた</span> <span begin="46.072" end="46.699">吐いた</span> <span begin="46.822" end="47.528">ツイッター</span><span begin="47.528" end="48.232">呟</span><span begin="48.232" end="49.306">く</span> <span begin="49.439" end="49.793">7</span><span begin="49.793" end="50.113">個</span><span begin="50.113" end="50.882">目の</span><span begin="50.882" end="51.226">方</span><span begin="51.226" end="51.544">で</span></p><p begin="51.678" end="57.569" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.678" end="52.878">ATP</span><span begin="52.878" end="53.674">上手に</span><span begin="53.674" end="54.073">受け</span><span begin="54.073" end="54.661">渡</span><span begin="54.661" end="55.556">す</span><span begin="55.920" end="56.504">日々だ</span><span begin="56.504" end="57.569">け</span></p></div><div begin="57.579" end="1:24.366" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="57.579" end="1:00.760" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.579" end="58.075">もう</span> <span begin="58.101" end="58.436">勘</span><span begin="58.436" end="58.875">が</span><span begin="58.875" end="59.459">冴えて</span><span begin="59.459" end="1:00.022">悔</span><span begin="1:00.022" end="1:00.760">しいわ</span></p><p begin="1:00.800" end="1:03.895" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.800" end="1:01.818">無意識に</span><span begin="1:01.818" end="1:02.301">運</span><span begin="1:02.301" end="1:02.869">べたら</span><span begin="1:02.869" end="1:03.242">楽</span><span begin="1:03.242" end="1:03.895">だろうな</span></p><p begin="1:04.331" end="1:09.635" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.331" end="1:04.801">淡</span><span begin="1:04.801" end="1:05.285">々</span><span begin="1:05.285" end="1:05.606">と</span><span begin="1:05.606" end="1:06.210">笑</span><span begin="1:06.210" end="1:07.269">えないわ</span> <span begin="1:07.305" end="1:07.679">取り</span><span begin="1:07.679" end="1:08.688">繕って</span><span begin="1:08.688" end="1:09.635">しまうわ</span></p><p begin="1:09.645" end="1:13.552" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.645" end="1:10.044">い</span><span begin="1:10.044" end="1:10.851">つも</span> <span begin="1:10.851" end="1:11.646">ゲラゲラ</span> <span begin="1:11.646" end="1:12.250">道を</span><span begin="1:12.250" end="1:12.858">塞ぐ</span><span begin="1:12.858" end="1:13.552">民よ</span></p><p begin="1:13.592" end="1:17.161" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:13.592" end="1:14.296">感謝</span><span begin="1:14.296" end="1:14.431">の</span><span begin="1:14.431" end="1:15.066">言葉</span><span begin="1:15.066" end="1:15.490">しか</span><span begin="1:15.490" end="1:15.910">出て</span><span begin="1:15.910" end="1:16.456">こない</span><span begin="1:16.456" end="1:17.161">よ</span></p><p begin="1:17.248" end="1:19.988" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:17.248" end="1:17.703">後</span><span begin="1:17.703" end="1:18.434">戻りは</span> <span begin="1:18.434" end="1:19.269">しなくて</span><span begin="1:19.269" end="1:19.665">いい</span><span begin="1:19.665" end="1:19.988">の</span></p><p begin="1:20.052" end="1:24.366" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:20.052" end="1:20.672">今の</span><span begin="1:20.672" end="1:21.284">ところ</span><span begin="1:21.284" end="1:21.978">は</span> <span begin="1:21.978" end="1:22.774">帰って</span><span begin="1:22.774" end="1:23.310">眠る</span><span begin="1:23.310" end="1:23.554">だ</span><span begin="1:23.554" end="1:24.366">け</span></p></div><div begin="1:38.227" end="1:50.851" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:38.227" end="1:41.318" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:38.227" end="1:38.848">おかしいと</span><span begin="1:38.848" end="1:39.394">思うほ</span><span begin="1:39.394" end="1:39.854">ど</span> <span begin="1:39.947" end="1:40.280">頷</span><span begin="1:40.280" end="1:40.502">いて</span><span begin="1:40.502" end="1:40.914">しまう</span><span begin="1:40.914" end="1:41.318">方法</span></p><p begin="1:41.430" end="1:44.555" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:41.430" end="1:42.101">顔に</span><span begin="1:42.101" end="1:42.506">出す</span><span begin="1:42.506" end="1:42.881">こと</span> <span begin="1:42.881" end="1:43.676">許され</span><span begin="1:43.676" end="1:44.034">なく</span><span begin="1:44.034" end="1:44.555">て</span></p><p begin="1:44.626" end="1:47.763" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:44.626" end="1:44.917">泣き</span><span begin="1:44.917" end="1:45.316">疲れて</span><span begin="1:45.316" end="1:45.514">し</span><span begin="1:45.514" end="1:45.811">ま</span><span begin="1:45.811" end="1:46.139">おう</span> <span begin="1:46.307" end="1:46.812">リセットを</span><span begin="1:46.812" end="1:47.069">覚</span><span begin="1:47.069" end="1:47.395">え</span><span begin="1:47.395" end="1:47.763">よう</span></p><p begin="1:47.857" end="1:50.851" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:47.857" end="1:48.427">興味</span><span begin="1:48.427" end="1:49.170">ないなら</span> <span begin="1:49.170" end="1:50.014">ほっとい</span><span begin="1:50.014" end="1:50.392">て</span><span begin="1:50.392" end="1:50.851">くれ</span></p></div><div begin="1:50.861" end="2:02.989" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:50.861" end="1:57.114" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:50.861" end="1:51.586">難関</span> <span begin="1:51.680" end="1:52.363">難解</span> <span begin="1:52.440" end="1:53.035">何階</span> <span begin="1:53.104" end="1:53.855">間違</span><span begin="1:53.855" end="1:54.666">う</span> <span begin="1:55.026" end="1:55.678">笑え</span><span begin="1:55.678" end="1:56.391">ない</span><span begin="1:56.391" end="1:57.114">ジョーク</span></p><p begin="1:57.204" end="2:02.989" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:57.204" end="1:57.984">来週</span><span begin="1:57.984" end="1:58.502">の</span><span begin="1:58.502" end="1:59.214">献立</span><span begin="1:59.214" end="1:59.418">を</span><span begin="1:59.418" end="1:59.930">眺</span><span begin="1:59.930" end="2:00.214">め</span><span begin="2:00.214" end="2:01.061">る</span><span begin="2:01.482" end="2:01.930">日々</span><span begin="2:01.930" end="2:02.158">だ</span><span begin="2:02.158" end="2:02.989">け</span></p></div><div begin="2:03.183" end=